  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibility Study - Bangladesh International Submarine Cable, through APTelecom</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A USTDA grant funds a feasibility study (Study) for CdNet Communications to support the development of the proposed Bangladesh International Submarine Cable (Bagha-1), a subsea cable which would help provide connectivity to Bangladesh. U.S. advisory firm, APTelecom LLC will carry out the Study on a sole-source basis.</narrative>
  </description>
